---
/**
 * Why Kaizen — bento-style asymmetric layout.
 * No boxes, no borders. Open, spacious, lightly animated.
 * SUCCESS: Simple (one trait per cell), Concrete, Unexpected.
 */
---

<section class="py-28 md:py-36 bg-[#f5f5f3]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 lg:px-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-20 md:mb-28 max-w-2xl">
      <p
        class="text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gray-400 uppercase mb-5 font-body"
      >
        Why Kaizen
      </p>
      <h2
        class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-heading font-bold text-gray-950 leading-tight"
      >
        Built different.<br />On purpose.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento grid — asymmetric, no boxes -->
    <div class="bento-grid">
      <!-- Large feature cell -->
      <div class="bento-cell bento-cell--large">
        <p class="bento-number font-heading">01</p>
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-gray-950 leading-snug mb-4">
          One person. Start to finish.
        </h3>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg font-body text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          You deal with the same person from first call to launch. No getting passed around. No repeating yourself. No "I'll check with the team."
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Tall accent cell -->
      <div class="bento-cell bento-cell--tall bento-cell--accent">
        <p class="bento-number font-heading text-white/30">02</p>
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-4">
          We fix what you have.
        </h3>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg font-body text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
          Most agencies want to rebuild from scratch. We'd rather make your existing site faster, cleaner, and actually earn its keep.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Standard cell -->
      <div class="bento-cell">
        <p class="bento-number font-heading">03</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-gray-950 leading-snug mb-3">
          Plain English. Always.
        </h3>
        <p class="text-base font-body text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          You'll understand every recommendation we make and exactly why it matters for your bottom line.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Standard cell -->
      <div class="bento-cell">
        <p class="bento-number font-heading">04</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-gray-950 leading-snug mb-3">
          Speed is the product.
        </h3>
        <p class="text-base font-body text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          Performance isn't a nice-to-have. It's baked into every decision — your site will pass Google's checks, not just look the part.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Wide cell -->
      <div class="bento-cell bento-cell--wide">
        <p class="bento-number font-heading">05</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-gray-950 leading-snug mb-3">
          No lock-in. No surprises.
        </h3>
        <p class="text-base font-body text-gray-500 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
          Transparent pricing before we start. Month-to-month support after launch. Stay because you want to, not because a contract says so.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bento-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2px;
    background: rgb(209 213 219 / 0.5);
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .bento-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .bento-cell--large {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: 1 / 3;
    }

    .bento-cell--tall {
      grid-column: 2;
      grid-row: 1 / 3;
    }

    .bento-cell--wide {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .bento-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      grid-template-rows: auto auto auto;
    }

    .bento-cell--large {
      grid-column: 1 / 3;
      grid-row: 1;
    }

    .bento-cell--tall {
      grid-column: 3;
      grid-row: 1 / 3;
    }

    .bento-cell--wide {
      grid-column: 1 / 3;
      grid-row: 3;
    }
  }

  .bento-cell {
    background: white;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    position: relative;
    transition: background-color 0.4s ease;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .bento-cell {
      padding: 3rem;
    }
  }

  .bento-cell:hover {
    background: rgb(250 250 249);
  }

  /* Accent cell — dark */
  .bento-cell--accent {
    background: rgb(3 7 18);
  }

  .bento-cell--accent:hover {
    background: rgb(15 23 42);
  }

  /* Animated number */
  .bento-number {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: rgb(209 213 219);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    display: block;
    transition: letter-spacing 0.4s ease;
  }

  .bento-cell:hover .bento-number {
    letter-spacing: 0.35em;
  }

  /* Subtle slide-up on hover */
  .bento-cell h3 {
    transition: transform 0.4s ease;
  }

  .bento-cell:hover h3 {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
</style>
